    "overview": {
      "type": "sp-pdp-overview",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "PRODUCT FAMILY",
        "heading": "Overview",
        "body": "<p>SemiProbe manual manipulators provide precise X, Y, and Z positioning of probe arms and probe tips on analytical, production, and benchtop probing systems. Designed for wafer-level probing, device characterization, and failure analysis, each manipulator delivers smooth, backlash-free movement across its entire travel range.</p><p>The family spans four distinct model series — from the compact MA-8005 for general probing down to 5 µm features, through the ultra-high-resolution MA-9100 offering 100 TPI and sub-micron positioning, to the specialized MA-8500 engineered specifically for high-frequency and millimeter-wave applications.</p>",
        "spec_1_label": "Kinematic Structure",
